. Generate PPCC plot for
.   1) Tukey-Lambda
.   2) Weibull
.   3) Lognormal
.   4) Gamma
.
x3label
title automatic
character x
line blank
y1label PPCC
multiplot 2 2
multiplot corner coordinates 2 2 98 98
x1label lambda
tukey-lambda ppcc plot y
justification center
move 50 5
text max ppcc = ^maxppcc, shape = ^shape
set minmax 1
x1label gamma
weibull ppcc plot y
justification center
move 50 5
text max ppcc = ^maxppcc, shape = ^shape
x1label gamma
gamma ppcc plot y
justification center
move 50 5
text max ppcc = ^maxppcc, shape = ^shape
x1label sd
lognormal ppcc plot y
justification center
move 50 5
text max ppcc = ^maxppcc, shape = ^shape
end of multiplot
. Finished
